     "allowance": "the stats row begins where the greeting ends, and this is the first thing in its first item — same cause as `stats` x, measured from the same two headings."
    },
    {
     "key": "brush",
     "field": "xr",
     "ref": 677.3,
     "app": 746,
     "delta": 68.7,
     "tol": 3,
     "allowance": "the ref's frequency control is a two-button chip pair (Weekly | Monthly) at 146px; ours is a native select, because this app offers THREE frequencies — Daily, Weekly, Monthly. Below the breakpoint the control row is left-aligned, so the brush starts earlier. Closing it means dropping a frequency the app supports."
    }
